sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Jogador A
  participant L as Lobby WS
  participant S as Sala WS
  participant R as Runtime
  participant B as Jogador B
  A->>L: create_room
  L-->>A: room_joined
  A->>S: conecta /ws/sala/id
  B->>L: join_room
  B->>S: conecta
  A->>S: ready
  B->>S: ready
  S->>R: GameSession.start
  R-->>A: coin_state (X/O 10s)
  R-->>B: coin_state
  R-->>A: match_state (por jogador)
  R-->>B: match_state
  R-->>A: match_end + recompensas
